16:00:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9462449550628662,"text_excerpt":"The quality of the food was fantastic. You're pretty much guaranteed the freshest meats since they do it all in-house. I had the BBQ pork sandwich and it was amazing. It was so flavorful. Also the bbq sauce was tasty. Highly recommend this place especially if you plan to visit the nearby museums just down the street"},{"business_id":"gTC8IQ_i8zXytWSly3Ttvg","review_id":"do2mjrrWBnHxvJvHbCxtAQ","date":"2015-12-24T03:09:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9446003437042236,"text_excerpt":"Cochon Butcher was great! The Cochon + Butcher combo is really similar to Publican and PQM in Chicago, so we almost didn't go. But I'm glad we did! The sandwiches here are really unique, the ambiance is really relaxed and fun, and the bar program is pretty solid too. So you can either order at the counter and sit down with a number so they can bring you the food, or you can get full service at the bar. We thought bar would be more fun, but the service, while friendly, was pretty sterile. We didn't really get a chance to chat with them because they were busy with the santas that overran the place while we were there. We got hot boudin (must try!), headcheese (a very generous portion and sp..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"gTC8IQ_i8zXytWSly3Ttvg","photo_id":"7rJunmXAAsu9Gq6bQNF5lQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7rJunmXAAsu9Gq6bQNF5lQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9022846221923828},{"business_id":"gTC8IQ_i8zXytWSly3Ttvg","photo_id":"OE9xyPf_cfNCePZXlLskng","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/OE9xyPf_cfNCePZXlLskng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8781828880310059},{"business_id":"gTC8IQ_i8zXytWSly3Ttvg","photo_id":"rbXOy_bi0xfwbvvna7u2jw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/rbXOy_bi0xfwbvvna7u2jw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8416599035263062},{"business_id":"gTC8IQ_i8zXytWSly3Ttvg","photo_id":"zoUFQmKvxaDZ0a197ktkHQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/zoUFQmKvxaDZ0a197ktkHQ.jpg